# Only the Go sources, the wrappers (fern-claude, fern-opencode, box-opencode, fern-gh), T3's patches and settings
# script, the lab node's entrypoint, and what install.sh takes from the fern
# image (the systemd units and the sample project) go into image builds.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!images/fern-claude
!images/fern-opencode
!images/box-opencode
!images/fern-gh
!images/t3
!images/t3-settings.js
!images/lab-node-start
!deploy/systemd
!lab/sample-repo
